silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_11_classification_leg_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'ClassificationLegConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, DomesticCat: the species-type classification node for Felis catus (domestic cat); a type in the local olog; distinct from the individual Mittens and distinct from the ITIS taxon row FelisCatusTSN183798; also, ClassificationArrow_DomesticCat: the typed arrow DomesticCat -> MittensColimitApex; distinct from taxonomy_leg (FelisCatusTSN183798 -> MittensColimitApex); also, CheeseViolation_MittensEqualsSpecies: the forbidden claim that the individual Mittens is identical to the species DomesticCat; blocked by face 1 immunity in the closure theorem." .
